{title: Chitthi Aayi Hai}
{artist: Pankaj Udhas Naam Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
[Fm],        Chithi hai vatan se chithi aayi hai
[Fm] [A#m],        Bade dino ke baad,
[A#m] [Fm],        ham bevatano ko yaad
[C] [Fm],        Vatan ki mitti aai hai
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
[Fm] [A#m],        Upar meraa naam likhaa hai,
[Fm],        Adar ye paigaam likhaa hai
[A#m],        O parades ko jaane vaale,
[A#m] [Fm],        Laut ke phir naa aane vaale
[Fm] [A#m],        Saat samudar paar gayaa tu,
[Fm] [A#m],        Hamako zidaa maar gayaa tu
[A#m],        Khun ke rishte tod gayaa tu,
[A#m] [Fm],        Aankh me aansu chhod gayaa tu
[Fm] [A#m],        Kam khaate hai
[A#m] [Fm],        kam sote hai,
[Fm],        Bahut zyaadaa ham rote hai
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
[Fm] [A#m],        Suni ho gai shahar ki galiyaan,
[Fm] [A#m],        Kaate ban gai baag ki kaliyaan
[A#m] [C],        Kahate hai saavan ke jhule,
[A#m] [C],        Bhul gayaa tu ham nahi bhule
[Fm] [A#m],        Tere bin jab aai divaali,
[Fm] [A#m],        Dip nahi dil jale hai khaali
[A#m],        Tere bin jab aai holi,
[A#m] [Fm],        Pichakaari se chhuti goli
[Fm],        Pipal sunaa panaghat sunaa ghar
[Fm],        Shamashaan kaa banaa namunaa
[C],        Fasal kati aai baisaakhi,
[A#m] [Fm],        Teraa aanaa rah gayaa baaki
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
[C],        Pahale jab tu khat likhataa thaa
[C],        Kaagaz me cheharaa dikhataa thaa
[A#m],        Band huaa ye mel bhi ab to,
[Fm],        Khatam huaa ye khel bhi ab to
[Fm],        Doli me jab baithi bahanaa,
[Fm],        Rastaa dekh rahe the nainaa
[C],        Mai to baap hun meraa kyaa hai,
[C],        Teri maan kaa haal buraa hai
[A#m],        Teri bivi karati hai sevaa,
[Fm],        Surat se lagati hai bevaa
[A#m] [C],        Tune paisaa bahut kamaayaa,
[A#m] [C],        Is paise ne desh chhudaayaa
[C],        Desh paraayaa chhod ke aajaa,
[C],        Pachhi pijaraa tod ke aajaa
[A#m],        Aajaa umar bahut hai chhoti,
[Fm],        Apane ghar me bhi hai roti
[Fm],        Chithi aai hai aai he chithi aai he
